[
  {
    "text": "So uh so welcome folks. Um",
    "start": 2.639,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, nice to uh see your names",
    "start": 7.12,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "there. Uh lovely.",
    "start": 10.32,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Um",
    "start": 13.36,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "yeah, my name is Matthew. I'm your",
    "start": 19.52,
    "duration": 3.999
  },
  {
    "text": "substitute teacher. You can call me",
    "start": 21.6,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "Matthew or Mr. Brent Silver.",
    "start": 23.519,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Um,",
    "start": 27.439,
    "duration": 5.361
  },
  {
    "text": "look forward to uh to practicing",
    "start": 29.039,
    "duration": 9.121
  },
  {
    "text": "with you and uh I'm unshaved but",
    "start": 32.8,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "caffeinated.",
    "start": 38.16,
    "duration": 7.239
  },
  {
    "text": "Gil gets up early 7",
    "start": 40.079,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh but I always um really enjoy",
    "start": 45.44,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "being with you and uh we'll find our",
    "start": 50.719,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "find our way.",
    "start": 53.84,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "So, um yeah, find uh find your posture",
    "start": 56.399,
    "duration": 9.201
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh we'll we'll practice",
    "start": 60.48,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And sometimes it can be useful to",
    "start": 122.96,
    "duration": 8.639
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of take our inner dharma posture",
    "start": 128.0,
    "duration": 11.72
  },
  {
    "text": "slowly getting into a yoga asa gently.",
    "start": 131.599,
    "duration": 8.121
  },
  {
    "text": "letting the mind, the attention",
    "start": 145.52,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "take its time together.",
    "start": 148.959,
    "duration": 4.121
  },
  {
    "text": "And then other times it can be useful",
    "start": 157.92,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "to see what it's like to put down",
    "start": 161.76,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "everything all at once and start on a",
    "start": 164.239,
    "duration": 6.36
  },
  {
    "text": "dime.",
    "start": 167.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of abrupt putting down of the",
    "start": 198.319,
    "duration": 6.361
  },
  {
    "text": "world.",
    "start": 201.68,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "There's a certain kind of almost",
    "start": 251.12,
    "duration": 5.8
  },
  {
    "text": "ruthlessness",
    "start": 253.92,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "in the way in which",
    "start": 258.799,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "we lay down",
    "start": 263.84,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "the complexities of our life.",
    "start": 266.479,
    "duration": 4.521
  },
  {
    "text": "And the only way we can do that, the",
    "start": 280.72,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "only way we can justify that is knowing",
    "start": 282.88,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "that that gesture, that radical gesture",
    "start": 286.16,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "of laying something down",
    "start": 288.72,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "will help us to love and serve more",
    "start": 294.88,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "deeply.",
    "start": 299.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So, you're invited warmly into this",
    "start": 319.12,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "realm of experience where",
    "start": 322.56,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "our life, our so-called life,",
    "start": 327.52,
    "duration": 9.32
  },
  {
    "text": "it's just a thought arising. Hey,",
    "start": 332.24,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "you",
    "start": 345.6,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "are",
    "start": 348.639,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the the siren calls of hope and fear",
    "start": 460.479,
    "duration": 6.201
  },
  {
    "text": "are neither answered nor completely",
    "start": 470.8,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "ignored. We",
    "start": 474.72,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "might feel the kind of tug",
    "start": 477.199,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "on the heart.",
    "start": 481.759,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Feel our way into",
    "start": 489.12,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of impact",
    "start": 494.96,
    "duration": 3.799
  },
  {
    "text": "of thought or memory or worry on our",
    "start": 499.599,
    "duration": 6.361
  },
  {
    "text": "body.",
    "start": 502.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And rather than trying to finish the",
    "start": 510.08,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "sentence, finish the story of the hope",
    "start": 512.32,
    "duration": 7.519
  },
  {
    "text": "or the fear,",
    "start": 516.479,
    "duration": 7.881
  },
  {
    "text": "the excitement or the sorrow.",
    "start": 519.839,
    "duration": 4.521
  },
  {
    "text": "We just feel its impact on our body.",
    "start": 526.72,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And in that way practice tending to the",
    "start": 532.56,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "experience",
    "start": 536.08,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "without abandoning",
    "start": 540.8,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "our heart in this present moment.",
    "start": 544.0,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Perhaps letting your your breathing",
    "start": 665.92,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "be like uh whispers uh from from the",
    "start": 673.2,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Buddha.",
    "start": 676.64,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Just inviting us",
    "start": 682.32,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "to",
    "start": 688.32,
    "duration": 7.88
  },
  {
    "text": "release into the present moment.",
    "start": 691.2,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And clinging is always",
    "start": 746.399,
    "duration": 5.801
  },
  {
    "text": "complicated.",
    "start": 749.2,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Letting go.",
    "start": 756.88,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Simple.",
    "start": 760.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Not of course always easy, but simple",
    "start": 766.16,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and simplifying.",
    "start": 769.839,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "Just letting go into our breathing.",
    "start": 781.6,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "the stickiness of",
    "start": 999.839,
    "duration": 7.641
  },
  {
    "text": "auditory thought",
    "start": 1003.36,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "or the words careening through the mind.",
    "start": 1008.48,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "The stickiness of that is often",
    "start": 1014.56,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "dependent",
    "start": 1016.88,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "on a lack of equinimity",
    "start": 1019.759,
    "duration": 7.881
  },
  {
    "text": "with feeling in our body.",
    "start": 1023.279,
    "duration": 4.361
  },
  {
    "text": "If we can have this uh very patient,",
    "start": 1030.559,
    "duration": 7.081
  },
  {
    "text": "tolerant,",
    "start": 1034.64,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "radical permission for feeling to be",
    "start": 1039.6,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "what it is rather than to be a",
    "start": 1043.12,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "commandment",
    "start": 1046.24,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "with instructions,",
    "start": 1048.799,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "demands.",
    "start": 1051.84,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And we can just allow",
    "start": 1058.08,
    "duration": 7.64
  },
  {
    "text": "feeling to be feeling",
    "start": 1060.96,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "the stickiness in the realm of thought",
    "start": 1067.039,
    "duration": 6.601
  },
  {
    "text": "starts to dissolve.",
    "start": 1069.6,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Other words, it feels",
    "start": 1075.679,
    "duration": 7.521
  },
  {
    "text": "safer to rest here.",
    "start": 1078.48,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Now",
    "start": 1083.2,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "a very simple way.",
    "start": 1086.0,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Let us uh just breathe together.",
    "start": 1097.28,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "It's important to uh",
    "start": 1289.6,
    "duration": 7.959
  },
  {
    "text": "appreciate the innocence",
    "start": 1293.6,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "of the movements of our mind.",
    "start": 1299.36,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "That really the incredible poignency",
    "start": 1306.0,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "of our mind",
    "start": 1314.08,
    "duration": 10.28
  },
  {
    "text": "trying to get what we feel we need.",
    "start": 1318.159,
    "duration": 6.201
  },
  {
    "text": "Protect ourselves",
    "start": 1325.36,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "from what's causes fear.",
    "start": 1329.52,
    "duration": 4.84
  },
  {
    "text": "You don't have to do",
    "start": 1341.28,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "loving kindness practice,",
    "start": 1345.679,
    "duration": 6.601
  },
  {
    "text": "self-compassion just to see",
    "start": 1347.28,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "how uh much it's needed.",
    "start": 1355.2,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "So we meet the surges of feeling",
    "start": 1382.72,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "hope and fear and the stickiness of uh",
    "start": 1390.08,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "thinking meet it with a",
    "start": 1393.679,
    "duration": 6.281
  },
  {
    "text": "gentle",
    "start": 1396.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "warmth",
    "start": 1402.72,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "signaling to the deep mind that",
    "start": 1410.0,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "what's important won't be neglected.",
    "start": 1417.36,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "But for right now,",
    "start": 1423.2,
    "duration": 3.719
  },
  {
    "text": "it's okay to be very simple.",
    "start": 1426.96,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Breathe.",
    "start": 1437.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1758.96,
    "duration": 3.089
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay,",
    "start": 1838.48,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "it's good to uh good to practice with",
    "start": 1840.799,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "you. I appreciate",
    "start": 1843.52,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "the uh love being exchanged in various",
    "start": 1845.44,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "directions in the uh chat there.",
    "start": 1848.559,
    "duration": 4.681
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 1854.399,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the uh poram is um a list of of 10 10",
    "start": 1857.6,
    "duration": 8.64
  },
  {
    "text": "virtues that as I I understand is",
    "start": 1863.679,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "composed after the Buddha's life",
    "start": 1866.24,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "and it um is speculated that the list",
    "start": 1869.6,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "was an attempt after the fact to",
    "start": 1873.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "understand how",
    "start": 1877.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the Buddha arose as his own teacher, you",
    "start": 1879.52,
    "duration": 6.639
  },
  {
    "text": "know,",
    "start": 1883.52,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh I wanted to to explore some of",
    "start": 1886.159,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "these uh kind of beautiful art qualities",
    "start": 1890.799,
    "duration": 5.721
  },
  {
    "text": "this week.",
    "start": 1893.279,
    "duration": 3.241
  },
  {
    "text": "So truthfulness",
    "start": 1897.279,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "with ourselves, with each other, with",
    "start": 1900.48,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "the moment,",
    "start": 1903.2,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "it's really kind of foundation of uh of",
    "start": 1905.36,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "the path.",
    "start": 1910.0,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "So the philosopher Metsinger says um the",
    "start": 1912.24,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "scientific very sober rigorous approach",
    "start": 1915.84,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "to reality and life and the spiritual",
    "start": 1919.519,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "approach to reality and life stem from",
    "start": 1922.96,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "the same values the same normative core",
    "start": 1926.159,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "that has something to do with",
    "start": 1931.76,
    "duration": 3.84
  },
  {
    "text": "truthfulness. I guess the English word",
    "start": 1932.96,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "is veracity.",
    "start": 1935.6,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "The will, the pure will",
    "start": 1938.0,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "to absolute veracity to accept the",
    "start": 1941.36,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "obligation of veracity",
    "start": 1944.72,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "towards oneself.",
    "start": 1947.519,
    "duration": 3.481
  },
  {
    "text": "As a child, um",
    "start": 1954.96,
    "duration": 8.839
  },
  {
    "text": "I I would get enraged by hypocrisy.",
    "start": 1958.32,
    "duration": 5.479
  },
  {
    "text": "That's not very, you know,",
    "start": 1964.0,
    "duration": 7.279
  },
  {
    "text": "that made me a little annoying,",
    "start": 1968.24,
    "duration": 5.039
  },
  {
    "text": "but",
    "start": 1971.279,
    "duration": 5.201
  },
  {
    "text": "it was strong in me. It was strong. I",
    "start": 1973.279,
    "duration": 7.681
  },
  {
    "text": "was like really deeply affected.",
    "start": 1976.48,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "And I didn't think that I knew what the",
    "start": 1980.96,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "ultimate truth was. In fact, I knew I",
    "start": 1984.0,
    "duration": 5.519
  },
  {
    "text": "didn't.",
    "start": 1987.2,
    "duration": 7.16
  },
  {
    "text": "But it wasn't hard to spot lies.",
    "start": 1989.519,
    "duration": 4.841
  },
  {
    "text": "And when I would see society say one",
    "start": 1994.399,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "thing and do another,",
    "start": 1997.679,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "or I would sense that that that someone",
    "start": 2000.399,
    "duration": 6.241
  },
  {
    "text": "was living deceptively,",
    "start": 2004.159,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "using words to hide",
    "start": 2006.64,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "truth.",
    "start": 2009.919,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "When I would notice something, but",
    "start": 2011.84,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "nobody would acknowledge or talk about",
    "start": 2014.559,
    "duration": 8.041
  },
  {
    "text": "it. pretending it wasn't there.",
    "start": 2017.44,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "It would um ignite so much feeling in",
    "start": 2022.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "me.",
    "start": 2026.88,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "That's sort of how I felt about duka,",
    "start": 2028.96,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, the suff suffering and not",
    "start": 2031.2,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "even suffering, just the intensity",
    "start": 2034.399,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "that I kept bumping into this",
    "start": 2037.519,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "allervasive thing that we weren't",
    "start": 2040.72,
    "duration": 5.959
  },
  {
    "text": "talking about.",
    "start": 2043.279,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "And as children, we we learn through our",
    "start": 2046.88,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "interactions with others, often a parent",
    "start": 2050.159,
    "duration": 8.401
  },
  {
    "text": "and and form this consensual",
    "start": 2055.44,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "reality.",
    "start": 2058.56,
    "duration": 6.079
  },
  {
    "text": "When you're experiencing",
    "start": 2061.359,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "uh coldness, here's more",
    "start": 2064.639,
    "duration": 6.801
  },
  {
    "text": "clothes. Here's a warmth.",
    "start": 2068.399,
    "duration": 4.641
  },
  {
    "text": "When you don't feel good because you're",
    "start": 2071.44,
    "duration": 4.479
  },
  {
    "text": "hungry, here's food. You're worthy of",
    "start": 2073.04,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "love. Here is love. Here's my love.",
    "start": 2075.919,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "And that kind of empathic connection is",
    "start": 2080.8,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "foundational",
    "start": 2083.679,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "and it it really helps um child make",
    "start": 2085.76,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "sense of the world together.",
    "start": 2089.919,
    "duration": 8.961
  },
  {
    "text": "And in in uh when I was in grad school,",
    "start": 2094.32,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "um research was focused around uh risk",
    "start": 2098.88,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "and resilience in",
    "start": 2102.88,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "uh kids who are maltreated.",
    "start": 2105.76,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "And um",
    "start": 2109.2,
    "duration": 7.68
  },
  {
    "text": "when many of those um uh kids faced",
    "start": 2112.24,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "trauma, part of what was so destructive",
    "start": 2116.88,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and so disorienting",
    "start": 2120.32,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "was that they didn't even know what was",
    "start": 2122.96,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "real. And this would come out in meeting",
    "start": 2125.2,
    "duration": 4.159
  },
  {
    "text": "with them.",
    "start": 2127.52,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you know, they didn't have um often",
    "start": 2129.359,
    "duration": 9.041
  },
  {
    "text": "anyone to help them realize like, yeah,",
    "start": 2133.68,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "this is true. This is real.",
    "start": 2138.4,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm sorry.",
    "start": 2141.68,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and honesty. Um,",
    "start": 2146.48,
    "duration": 8.879
  },
  {
    "text": "helping each other make sense of",
    "start": 2150.56,
    "duration": 9.6
  },
  {
    "text": "reality feels like a kind of moral debt.",
    "start": 2155.359,
    "duration": 8.881
  },
  {
    "text": "You know, we owe it to each other so",
    "start": 2160.16,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "that that uh they can make sense of",
    "start": 2164.24,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "their lives.",
    "start": 2168.64,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the the um terra terrain commentary says",
    "start": 2172.32,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "all evil states",
    "start": 2176.4,
    "duration": 9.28
  },
  {
    "text": "converge upon the transgression of truth",
    "start": 2179.359,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "like gives you an idea of how",
    "start": 2185.68,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "fundamental this",
    "start": 2187.359,
    "duration": 6.961
  },
  {
    "text": "capacity uh for for honesty truthfulness",
    "start": 2189.92,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "Gil has said mindfulness practice just",
    "start": 2194.32,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "honesty practice",
    "start": 2196.8,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "and to deceive believe another is to",
    "start": 2200.48,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "induce some measure of delusion",
    "start": 2202.88,
    "duration": 7.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2207.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "that is um",
    "start": 2211.44,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "that that's harm",
    "start": 2214.0,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the the the Buddha said one who feels no",
    "start": 2217.359,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "conflict in telling kind of deliberate",
    "start": 2220.0,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "lie there's no harm that they will not",
    "start": 2222.96,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "do",
    "start": 2225.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and Um",
    "start": 2228.8,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "then there's this this related issue,",
    "start": 2231.839,
    "duration": 5.441
  },
  {
    "text": "not quite",
    "start": 2234.88,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "a lie, but um but",
    "start": 2237.28,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Excuse my language,",
    "start": 2242.0,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "but a famous essay from Harry Frankfurt",
    "start": 2244.24,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "1986",
    "start": 2247.119,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "distinguishing BS from lying",
    "start": 2249.28,
    "duration": 9.44
  },
  {
    "text": "and um said um the bullshitter cannot be",
    "start": 2253.2,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "regarded as lying for they do not",
    "start": 2258.72,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "presume that they know the truth. Their",
    "start": 2260.72,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "statement is neither grounded",
    "start": 2263.76,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "uh in a belief that it is true nor as a",
    "start": 2266.4,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "lie must be in a belief that is not",
    "start": 2269.92,
    "duration": 7.199
  },
  {
    "text": "true. It is just this lack of connection",
    "start": 2272.72,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "to a concern with the truth. This",
    "start": 2277.119,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "indifference to how things really are",
    "start": 2280.48,
    "duration": 9.68
  },
  {
    "text": "that I regard as the essence of",
    "start": 2285.119,
    "duration": 8.041
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2290.16,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "As dharma practitioners,",
    "start": 2293.52,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "we take a stand, a firm stand against",
    "start": 2296.079,
    "duration": 8.241
  },
  {
    "text": "that in our personal lives, in our",
    "start": 2300.64,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "public lives.",
    "start": 2304.32,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "At at various times in my practice, I",
    "start": 2308.32,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "just felt such a deep longing like let",
    "start": 2311.04,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "me",
    "start": 2313.52,
    "duration": 3.839
  },
  {
    "text": "understand. I don't even care if the",
    "start": 2315.119,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "truth makes me happier. Just let me",
    "start": 2317.359,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "understand.",
    "start": 2319.599,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so in this moment, this political",
    "start": 2323.2,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "moment, at least in this country, the",
    "start": 2325.92,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "United States where I am,",
    "start": 2328.88,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh when there's so much uh so much",
    "start": 2331.92,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "deception",
    "start": 2336.24,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and such pervasive BS, such fundamental",
    "start": 2337.76,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "indifference",
    "start": 2342.8,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "to how things really are,",
    "start": 2344.48,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "I find myself returned to a kind",
    "start": 2348.079,
    "duration": 6.441
  },
  {
    "text": "adolescent rage.",
    "start": 2350.72,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "And this anger then motivates a kind of",
    "start": 2355.359,
    "duration": 9.681
  },
  {
    "text": "deep wish to show them, whoever them is,",
    "start": 2358.24,
    "duration": 11.119
  },
  {
    "text": "no, you're wrong. This kind of hunger to",
    "start": 2365.04,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "prove something for the final piece of",
    "start": 2369.359,
    "duration": 6.321
  },
  {
    "text": "evidence to be revealed. This was always",
    "start": 2372.88,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "a con.",
    "start": 2375.68,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And it feels like I'm trying to maintain",
    "start": 2379.839,
    "duration": 9.121
  },
  {
    "text": "my epistemic sanity, epistemic like",
    "start": 2383.28,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you know from philosophy capacity to",
    "start": 2388.96,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "know theory of knowledge",
    "start": 2391.44,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "trying to maintain that",
    "start": 2394.079,
    "duration": 5.121
  },
  {
    "text": "but marshalling evidence doesn't matter",
    "start": 2396.88,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "in the face of indifference to truth.",
    "start": 2399.2,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And so that then sends me into a kind of",
    "start": 2404.0,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "self-righteous spiral where I need to",
    "start": 2407.04,
    "duration": 8.319
  },
  {
    "text": "find others who completely totally agree",
    "start": 2410.88,
    "duration": 9.239
  },
  {
    "text": "with exactly my view.",
    "start": 2415.359,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "And I get where all that comes from, but",
    "start": 2420.4,
    "duration": 7.8
  },
  {
    "text": "it is not a healthy cycle.",
    "start": 2423.52,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "It's got to be some different way.",
    "start": 2428.4,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "How how do we honor the truth,",
    "start": 2432.4,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "you know?",
    "start": 2438.16,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Well,",
    "start": 2440.4,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "we",
    "start": 2442.56,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "begin. Yeah. May May we treasure",
    "start": 2445.119,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "treasure the truth. May we speak it as",
    "start": 2449.119,
    "duration": 7.401
  },
  {
    "text": "best we can discern it.",
    "start": 2451.839,
    "duration": 4.681
  },
  {
    "text": "the the the paramei saka",
    "start": 2457.119,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "and we try to do that. I try to do that",
    "start": 2461.52,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "here in the dharma. This field of",
    "start": 2464.24,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "honesty where",
    "start": 2467.359,
    "duration": 4.401
  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 2470.0,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "the urge to be deceptive is is a kind of",
    "start": 2471.76,
    "duration": 10.2
  },
  {
    "text": "instant karmic effect we can discern.",
    "start": 2476.72,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "May I give up on samsara in a way? I I",
    "start": 2483.68,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "cannot make my sanity dependent",
    "start": 2488.24,
    "duration": 8.879
  },
  {
    "text": "on the world honoring truthfulness.",
    "start": 2492.48,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "And to enter a bad faith debate is to",
    "start": 2497.119,
    "duration": 7.161
  },
  {
    "text": "lose.",
    "start": 2501.28,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "May I be relentless in perceiving",
    "start": 2505.44,
    "duration": 7.639
  },
  {
    "text": "selfdeception.",
    "start": 2510.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "When I dimly sense that perhaps I'm like",
    "start": 2514.96,
    "duration": 6.879
  },
  {
    "text": "pulling a fast one on myself, may I not",
    "start": 2518.24,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "live cocooned in the kind of mythic",
    "start": 2521.839,
    "duration": 7.881
  },
  {
    "text": "story of my own ego.",
    "start": 2525.68,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "Tanya uh Lamroso said um people think",
    "start": 2531.04,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "that they're like scientists, but we're",
    "start": 2535.2,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "actually more like trial lawyers.",
    "start": 2537.28,
    "duration": 8.079
  },
  {
    "text": "not actually looking for",
    "start": 2541.52,
    "duration": 7.839
  },
  {
    "text": "all evidence evenly. We've predetermined",
    "start": 2545.359,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "what's true and then are making the case",
    "start": 2549.359,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "for that.",
    "start": 2552.48,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "May I May I take a stand in my own heart",
    "start": 2554.96,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "against that?",
    "start": 2558.16,
    "duration": 3.4
  },
  {
    "text": "May I listen to others. Truth is uh",
    "start": 2564.0,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "closer to a property of diads than an",
    "start": 2568.24,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "individual. We cannot see the back of",
    "start": 2571.04,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "our head. We cannot know without others.",
    "start": 2575.04,
    "duration": 8.559
  },
  {
    "text": "We cannot uproot delusion",
    "start": 2580.4,
    "duration": 8.959
  },
  {
    "text": "without listening deeply to others",
    "start": 2583.599,
    "duration": 10.681
  },
  {
    "text": "to others who care about the truth.",
    "start": 2589.359,
    "duration": 4.921
  },
  {
    "text": "Nichze um said um",
    "start": 2594.8,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "that uh truth is aortioned according to",
    "start": 2598.96,
    "duration": 6.76
  },
  {
    "text": "one's strength.",
    "start": 2602.4,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "May yeah may may we be strong enough to",
    "start": 2606.319,
    "duration": 8.76
  },
  {
    "text": "tolerate truth.",
    "start": 2611.359,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And then there is sana a place where we",
    "start": 2616.72,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "don't have to",
    "start": 2619.92,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "uh pretend what's in front of our eyes",
    "start": 2622.24,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "isn't there.",
    "start": 2625.359,
    "duration": 3.401
  },
  {
    "text": "such a kind of the spirit of of the",
    "start": 2629.52,
    "duration": 7.72
  },
  {
    "text": "dharma. It's very",
    "start": 2632.88,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "undefended against truth",
    "start": 2637.44,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "and um",
    "start": 2644.64,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "nature bats last anyway, which is to say",
    "start": 2646.8,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe we say ane bats last, truth bats",
    "start": 2650.88,
    "duration": 7.32
  },
  {
    "text": "last.",
    "start": 2655.2,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And so let's",
    "start": 2658.4,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "discover how to let go of illusion,",
    "start": 2661.28,
    "duration": 8.319
  },
  {
    "text": "the illusion of holding.",
    "start": 2666.24,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's discover how to let go of the",
    "start": 2669.599,
    "duration": 5.041
  },
  {
    "text": "illusion of holding on",
    "start": 2671.839,
    "duration": 7.401
  },
  {
    "text": "uh before that illusion is shattered.",
    "start": 2674.64,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "offer this for your",
    "start": 2680.319,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "consideration",
    "start": 2683.52,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh we'll keep going tomorrow. I wish",
    "start": 2685.599,
    "duration": 6.081
  },
  {
    "text": "you a good day. Maybe it's a kind of",
    "start": 2688.72,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "contemplation of this kind of fidelity,",
    "start": 2691.68,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "veracity,",
    "start": 2697.68,
    "duration": 3.6
  },
  {
    "text": "commitment,",
    "start": 2699.28,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "ways in which we",
    "start": 2701.28,
    "duration": 5.799
  },
  {
    "text": "the",
    "start": 2704.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the ways in which the curation of self",
    "start": 2708.64,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "often involves some subtle",
    "start": 2711.2,
    "duration": 5.879
  },
  {
    "text": "deceptiveness.",
    "start": 2714.079,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's um honor the uh truth today.",
